  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo en Servicios de Desarrollo Empresarial a Empresas Exportadoras Paraguayas</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Business Development Services to Paraguayan Exporting Companies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir al incremento y diversificacin de las exportaciones paraguayas. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) ampliar la oferta exportable y los mercados atendidos; (ii) mejorar las capacidades de gestin en inteligencia y promocin comercial; y (iii) aumentar y diversificar la oferta exportable en la zona fronteriza.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s general objective is to contribute to the increase and diversification of Paraguayan exports. The specific objectives are to: (i) expand the export basket and markets served; (ii) build management capacity in trade intelligence and promotion; and (iii) increase and diversify the supply of exportable products in the border
region.</narrative>
  </description>
